<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahrend sees substantial rise in profits.</title>
<headline>Ahrend sees substantial rise in profits.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office equipment group Ahrend NV said on Tuesday it expected a substantial increase in profits in 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier the company reported first-half profits of 27.6 million guilders versus 24.1 million guilders in the same period of 1996.  </p>
<p>&quot;For the whole of the year Ahrend sees - under current market circumstances - a substantial increase in profits,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
